{"ts":"2026-09-07T22:58:28.455Z","author":"codex-hosted-collaboration","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6-astra","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"221f7c8d3df7288682c60f18","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6-astra","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-web-gixc"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Refresh connected project viewers after the realtime database listener reconnects"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The PostgreSQL LISTEN connection retries after a disconnect but does not invalidate the SSE clients that stayed connected. Notifications during that interval are transient and lost, so metadata or remote mutations can remain stale until an unrelated later event or a browser reload. Reproduce against a dedicated throwaway PostgreSQL listener and real HTTP event streams; reconnect must emit a bounded local workspace refresh for every active project without forwarding the refresh back to the shared bus."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-09-07T22:58:28.455Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-07T22:58:28.455Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex-hosted-collaboration"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A real PostgreSQL disconnect followed by a notification during the gap yields a refresh on each still-connected project stream after LISTEN succeeds; later project notifications retain tenant isolation; initial startup and stopped listeners do not emit reconnect refreshes; installed CLI 2026.9.7 real SDK tests and release checks remain green; report remaining whole-source coverage and hosted rollout gates accurately."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-web-2rek","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-09-07T22:58:28.455Z","author":"codex-hosted-collaboration","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"63d56188f55f2aea86244c525b7dd8b7d4b265599a737e81b4aec49a04b666a4","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"ebda9f3bbb0ce09166a2e8193b20933386a437bef88bb45a15ff40cb629005a0"}
